<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sovran started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sovran started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of Sovran Self Storage Inc with near-term neutral and long-term accumulate ratings.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 26-1/8 on Tuesday.</p>
